@startuml
title Cyber AI - Admin User Management Sequence

actor Admin
participant "AdminDashboard" as UI
participant "useAuth.ts" as Auth
participant "API Routes" as API
database "Supabase DB" as DB

== Access admin view ==
Admin -> UI : navigate to admin hash
UI -> Auth : isAdmin()
Auth -> DB : SELECT role FROM profiles WHERE id = auth.uid()
DB --> Auth : role = 'admin'
Auth --> UI : true
UI --> Admin : show Admin dashboard

== Load user list ==
UI -> API : GET /api/admin/users
API -> DB : SELECT id, email, full_name, role, created_at FROM profiles
DB --> API : rows
API --> UI : user list
UI --> Admin : display users

== Filter / search ==
Admin -> UI : type filter
UI -> API : GET /api/admin/users?search=...
API -> DB : SELECT ... WHERE email ILIKE ... OR full_name ILIKE ...
DB --> API : filtered rows
API --> UI : filtered list
UI --> Admin : show results

== Change role ==
Admin -> UI : select user, pick new role
UI -> API : PATCH /api/admin/users/:id (role)
API -> DB : UPDATE profiles SET role = ... WHERE id = ...
DB --> API : ok
API --> UI : updated
UI --> Admin : show success

== Delete user ==
Admin -> UI : click Delete
UI -> API : DELETE /api/admin/users/:id
API -> DB : DELETE FROM profiles WHERE id = ...
DB --> API : ok (cascade deletes auth.users)
API --> UI : deleted
UI --> Admin : remove from list

== Back to chat ==
Admin -> UI : click Back to chat
UI -> UI : clear admin hash
UI --> Admin : show Chat workspace
@enduml
